---
description: Homelab deploy conventions (read AGENTS.md)
alwaysApply: true
---

This repo deploys to real machines when changes merge to `main`.
Before changing anything, read and follow `AGENTS.md` at the repo root.

Non-negotiables:
- Work on a branch and open a PR. Never push to `main`.
- New services: `python scripts/new_service.py ...`, never hand-copied.
- Run `python scripts/validate.py` before every PR; 0 errors required.
- Never commit secrets; use Komodo `[[SECRET]]` references in the stack's environment.
- `hosts/orangepi/**` runs on arm64.
